locales/en.arb:34: `n` is counted by a plural in `pluralOfString`, so its type must be int or num, not String
locales/en.arb:39: the placeholders `user_name` and `userName` of `sameParam` would both be the parameter `user_name`; rename one
locales/en.arb:36: `n` is matched by a select in `selectOfInt`, so its type must be String, not int
